# IT Infrastructure RFP 2026 — Request for Proposal

**Document type:** Formal RFP
**Classification:** Confidential
**Issued by:** Acme Corp IT Procurement
**Issue date:** January 2026
**Submission deadline:** March 31, 2026

---

## 1. Overview

Acme Corp is soliciting proposals from qualified vendors for the provision of cloud infrastructure services and on-premises hardware to support our Q3 FY26 infrastructure modernization program.

## 2. Scope of Work

### 2.1 Cloud Infrastructure Services
- Compute: minimum 500 vCPUs across at least 2 regions
- Storage: minimum 5PB scalable object storage
- Networking: VPN, private peering, DDoS protection
- Managed Kubernetes or equivalent container orchestration
- Managed database services (PostgreSQL-compatible)

### 2.2 On-Premises Hardware
- High-density blade servers for colocation
- SAN/NAS storage arrays
- Network switching and redundancy

## 3. Technical Requirements

| Requirement ID | Description                                      | Priority |
|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|----------|
| TR-001         | 99.99% compute SLA                               | Must Have|
| TR-002         | Multi-region active-active deployment            | Must Have|
| TR-003         | SOC 2 Type II certification                      | Must Have|
| TR-004         | ISO 27001 certification                          | Must Have|
| TR-005         | GDPR Data Processing Agreement available         | Must Have|
| TR-006         | FedRAMP authorization (Moderate)                 | Should Have|
| TR-007         | Dedicated support team with 4-hour SLA response  | Must Have|
| TR-008         | Migration tooling and professional services team | Must Have|

## 4. Evaluation Rubric

Proposals will be scored on:
- Cost (30%) — 5-year TCO
- Technical capability (25%)
- SLA terms (20%)
- Security compliance (15%)
- Migration support (10%)

## 5. Submission Requirements

Proposals must include:
1. Signed cover letter from authorized representative
2. 5-year TCO model with itemized line items
3. Compliance matrix against all TR requirements
4. References from three comparable deployments
5. Signed GDPR Data Processing Agreement

## 6. Evaluation Timeline

| Milestone            | Date           |
|----------------------|----------------|
| RFP issue            | Jan 15, 2026   |
| Questions due        | Feb 14, 2026   |
| Proposals due        | Mar 31, 2026   |
| Evaluation complete  | Apr 30, 2026   |
| Award notification   | May 15, 2026   |
| Contract start       | Jul 1, 2026    |

